	'k19fcec11' => 'Clara Weiss leads admissions, coordinating our monthly open mornings, scheduling one-hour practical trial sessions, and conducting applicant interviews. Together, Samuel and Clara ensure that student intake numbers remain capped at 14 learners and that the training floor operates with the calm, systematic efficiency expected in high-end commercial salons.',
